  "solution": {
    "text": "The given compound X must be  <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub></math> . It can be explained by following reaction<br/><br/> <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mover accent=\"false\"><mo>→</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow></mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>↑</mo></math> <br/><br/> <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>→</mo><munder><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><msub><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Y</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></munder></math> <br/><br/> <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><msub><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>→</mo><munder><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><msub><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Z</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></munder></math> <br/><br/> <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><msub><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mover accent=\"false\"><mo>→</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow></mover><munder><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></munder><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>↑</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math>"
